OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 60 jobs at risk as
OL,4,Ahospice proposes cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospice charity has launched a staff
OL,7,Fconsultation over proposed job cuts as
OL,8,Fit seeks to reduce costs by #3.5m a
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FPrincess Alice Hospice, based in Esher,
OL,12,FSurrey, said 62 roles were at risk as
OL,13,Fit attempted to secure its long-term
OL,14,Ffuture.
OL,16,FThe charity said it cost about #13m a
OL,17,Fyear to run its services, with NHS
OL,18,Ffunding covering 23% of that amount and
OL,19,Fthe remainder coming from donations,
OL,20,Fcharity shops and fundraising.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
