OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 60 jobs at risk as
OL,4,Ahospice proposes cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief executive Nigel Seymour said:
OL,7,F"Hospices across the country are facing
OL,8,Fthe same pressures, and many have
OL,9,Falready had to make changes like
OL,10,Fthese."
